{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_03_end",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_03",
  "title": "安全屋攻防戰",
  "storyCode": "OD-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "55204ad149315530f657c16fc4dd12e206c2068830857c2c404d313d18c9b9de",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "雷鳴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "啊啊啊啊......我的眼睛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "術師呢！幹掉那個瓦伊凡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "想都別想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "什麼情況，又多了一批人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "怎麼搞的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "情況不妙，這些人的火力太兇猛了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "不要在這裡節外生枝，先撤退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......我看見你了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "呃啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "小心狙擊手！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "媽的，在哪？！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "別找了，撤了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......你跑不掉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲雇傭兵",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "撤！快撤！別管了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "他們跑了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "報告情況！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "亞歷山大，你沒事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "沒事，皮外傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這些傢伙學聰明了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "不要放鬆警惕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "還有其他人在這。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "......已經靠得夠近了，朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "雖然我感謝你們出手相助，但是在我們彼此搞清狀況以前，還是保持一點安全距離比較好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "不要緊張，我們沒有敵意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我們是羅德島的外勤小隊！你們現在駐紮的區域是羅德島的安全屋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "我們是來回應安全屋的求援信號的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "請你們表明身份。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "冷靜點，我們是來幫忙的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "是那個羅德島的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "嘿，還真的把救兵叫來了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "去叫奧克芬先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "瞭解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "text": "羅德島幹員？太好了啊，得救了！得救了啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "text": "具體的情況就是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "所以最後這四個雇傭兵就在這裡搭建了臨時陣地？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "text": "實在是抱歉，通訊器被破壞了，安全屋也沒守住......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧克芬",
      "text": "你們要是現在就辭退我，我也沒什麼怨言......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "不要擔心，老夫也沒有辭退你的權力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "而且依老夫來看，你能堅持到現在已經很了不起了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "要不是你，這些感染者的命運會更糟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "這裡有多少感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "算上外面那個醫生，總共四十三個人，都是感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "那四個傭兵一直在保護這些感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "主動保護感染者的傭兵，這年頭可太少見了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "完全不歧視感染者，甚至主動保護感染者的雇傭兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "可能是我太多疑了，這是從哪兒來的聖人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "但是他們好像沒有這個意識。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "聽他們的語氣，感覺只是保護了普通的無辜鎮民。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "與其說是“不歧視”感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "他們更像是“不在乎礦石病”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "但是他們看起來也不像是感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我從來沒有見過他們這樣的傭兵，也沒聽說過“虹彩小隊”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "他們都拿著銃哎，而且怎麼看都不是薩科塔人吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "除非薩科塔人已經有辦法把“日光燈”藏起來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "非薩科塔雇傭兵全員裝備大型銃器，這絕對會變成大新聞的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "黑鋼裝備研發部門的人知道了這件事，絕對要發瘋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......還是不要在背後議論別人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "無論如何，他們救助了羅德島的幹員，保護了感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "沒有證據之前，我們也不該懷疑他們的動機。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "當務之急，是想辦法解決目前的困境。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "我們需要和他們商量一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "他們進去有一陣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這個羅德島，你怎麼看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "我其實一直很好奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "什麼樣的製藥企業和醫療公司，會需要在偏遠的邊陲城鎮周邊安插一個堆滿了軍火的安全屋？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "那些爆炸物和武器，都能武裝一個步兵班了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "而且這些“製藥公司”的幹員，看起來各個都是專業武裝人員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "要嘛是這世界裡當醫生都得武裝到牙齒了，要嘛製藥企業是個幌子，可能兩者皆有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "他們雖然是武裝人員，但是看起來訓練有素，而且談吐得體。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "和我們之前遇到的歪瓜裂棗可不太一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "而且......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "可能是我的錯覺，但是我總能從他們身上感覺到很熟悉的氛圍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "這個，我倒是同意你的看法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "至少他們是講道理的文明人，我之前對這整個世界的印象就是個土匪流寇遍地走的末日啟示錄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "傷口包紮好了，亞歷山大先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "謝謝你，醫生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "醫生，你瞭解這個叫作羅德島的組織嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "......我從大篷車商隊那裡聽到過一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "他們是專門救治感染者的組織，也是研究礦石病的科研機構。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "但是這種病不是治不好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "是啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "其實過去有不少人自稱“能夠治癒礦石病”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "這些人大部分是騙子，騙局敗露之後各個下場淒慘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "極少數不是騙子的人，也都是誇大了“抑制礦石病症狀”的效果，這些能夠“抑制礦石病”的藥物也極其昂貴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "我猜也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "我以前聽說，某個領主的女兒得了礦石病，這位領主為了救自己的女兒，從哥倫比亞高價購買了抑制藥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "幾年以後，領主的財富全部消耗殆盡，他的女兒也在病痛中死去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "但是你們看這個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "這是什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "這是安全屋裡儲備的礦石病抑制藥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "這幾天我給一些病重的人注射了這種藥，它確實能夠有效抑制礦石病，而且藥效比我以前見過的所有產品都好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "這樣的藥......一定非常昂貴吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "但是奧克芬先生完全不在乎這件事，當我告訴他有人病得非常嚴重，他就給了我一盒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "我不是不相信這片大地上有好人，只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "嘿，這我倒是真沒想到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "別多想了，猜忌的成本太高。不管你是否表露出來，都不利於接下來的溝通。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "既然大家的目標是一致的，很多事情不妨直接放到檯面上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "聽你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "哦，他們出來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "不好意思，讓各位久等了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "就讓我省略客套話吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "謝謝你們救了奧克芬，若不是你們，羅德島會失去一位盡職盡責的幹員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "這次任務結束後，我會提交報告，羅德島會給四位合適的報酬與物資補償。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "報酬啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "有報酬是好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "另外，你們願意為感染者挺身而出，老夫由衷地表示敬佩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "這些鎮民這段時間也幫了我們很多，見死不救不是我們的行事風格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "所以你們是雇傭兵？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "不......我們......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "是，我們就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我們是雇傭兵，很貴的那種。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "能透漏一下你們所屬的公司嗎？像你們這樣的雇傭兵實在是太少見了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "呃......我們是......呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "（俄語）幫忙想個公司名字！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "（俄語）北極熊物流？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "如果不方便透漏也沒有關係，我明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我們......我們來自一個很遙遠的國家，在......在南邊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "對！我們來自很南邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "南邊？薩爾貢南邊？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "穿過焚風熱土？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "焚......對，就是來自那邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "穿過焚風熱土還有其他國家？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "這可真是......震撼老夫，這麼多年來可是第一次聽說這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "就算是薩爾貢王酋的歷史記載中，也從未提及有人曾經穿越乾旱之地而來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "（俄語）你編故事也稍微好一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "（俄語）北極熊物流聽起來就比較好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "總之，操著烏薩斯和維多利亞口音的戰士們，你們來自何處都不重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "你們願意為感染者而戰，在這件事上我們的目的是一致的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "至少現在，至少我們能夠一起面對現在的困境。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "我同意你的看法，老先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "所以，誰能告訴我們，鎮子上到底出什麼事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "薩卡茲傭兵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "操縱怪物的，應該是術師。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "有組織，有紀律，更重要的是懂得知難而退，這不是臨時起意的劫掠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "他們的裝備齊全，全都是哥倫比亞產的軍備，之前圍攻安全屋的時候，還有幾個很厲害的傢伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "這個裝備和戰術，應該是簽了“紅標合約”的專業傭兵了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "這恐怕是一場針對領主的叛亂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "但是他們為什麼要襲擊平民？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "他們從感染者社區一路跟著我們到了這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "這些傭兵到底想要什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "最大的可能性是滅口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "恐怕不只是要滅口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你是怎麼看的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "他們昨天襲擊感染者社區的時候，很明顯是沖著病人們去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "他們想把那些病人帶走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "我覺得這才是這群人的目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "綁架......感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "這又是什麼道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "敵人的目的撲朔迷離，但這並不是眼下最緊要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "目前，最好的辦法是等待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "等待？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "雖然目前沒有任何徵兆，但是只從既成事實的角度來談的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "我們沒有獲得王酋的許可，就持械進入了王酋的領地。無論於王酋的戒律還是本地的法律，我們都已經犯了薩爾貢的大忌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "鎮上的貴族深陷兵馬之亂，但他們在此地的統治依然存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "此時再插手任何事情，都會讓情況對我們更加不利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "本地領主設立了感染者社區，說明他不是殘暴無情之人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "他同意羅德島在這裡設立安全屋，說明他不是封閉自守之人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "我相信他會給我們一個公正的待遇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "國家律法......地方政府......我能理解。那現在也只能希望如此了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "在有更多情況變化之前，我們要固守這個安全屋，等待鎮上的騷亂結束。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "希望你們能夠幫助我們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "不用客氣，我們也需要羅德島的專業支援。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "那麼，四位，合作愉快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
